        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 4.4.1. A meeting shall be held to discuss the grievance within seven (7) working days (Monday through Friday) following the day the grievance was submitted to the Regional Director-Labor/Employee Relations or his/her representative unless such meeting is waived by mutual agreement of the Company and Union. The Union shall be provided a written response to the grievance within fourteen (14) working days (Monday through Friday) following the date on which the second step hearing is conducted. The procedure set forth in Section 4.4 and 4.4.1 shall be known as the second step of the grievance procedure.",
